  "instructions": [
    "Heat a nonstick skillet over medium heat and add a splash of oil.",
    "Add minced garlic, sliced shallot, and grated ginger, sauté until fragrant.",
    "Stir in tamarind paste and deglaze the pan with 1 cup of water.",
    "Add fish sauce, lime juice, palm sugar, and chili flakes, bring to a gentle simmer.",
    "Reduce heat to low and stir in coconut milk, cooking for 2 minutes until sauce thickens.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning, adding more lime or sugar if needed.",
    "Remove from heat and let the nam prik cool slightly before serving.",
    "Garnish with crushed roasted peanuts and serve with steamed rice or fresh vegetables."
